(comment AlJubaylRefinery "An #$OilRefinery located in the #$CityOfAlJubaylSaudiArabia, controlled by #$PetrominLubricatingOilCompany and #$ShellOilCompany. Its production capacity is 292,000 barrels per day.")
(comment RasAl-KhafjiRefinery "An #$OilRefinery located in the #$CityOfRasAl-KhafjiSaudiArabia, controlled by the #$ArabianOilCompany.  Its production capacity is 30,000 barrels per day.")
(comment PeabodyHoldingCo "Peabody Group is one of the largest private sector coal producers in the world and owns and operates mines in the United States and in Australia.  Peabody Group is headquartered in St. Louis, Mo. and its homepage can be found at:  http://www.peabodygroup.com/PHCIHome.html .")
(comment HamptonRoads "Hampton Roads is an anchorage (part of a #$BodyOfWater).  That concept is not in Cyc as of 9 January 2001.  Even if some document declares it to be a #$PortCity, it should not be so in non-proprietary parts of the KB, specifically in #$UnitedStatesGeographyMt.")
(comment CustomsCooperationCouncil "An international organization whose aim is to promote international cooperation in customs matters.")
(comment G19Organization "The international organization established in October, 1975 with the aim of representing the interests of the less developed countries that participated in the Conference on International Economic Cooperation (CIEC) in 1975 and 1977.")
(comment G77Organization "An international organization of 77 countries established in October 1967 with the aim of promoting economic cooperation among developing countries. Although more than 77 countries are currently members, the original name persists.")
(comment InternationalBankForReconstructionAndDevelopment "An international organization whose aim is to provide economic development loans.")
(comment InternationalCivilAviationOrganization "An international organization whose aim is to promote international cooperation in civil aviation.")
(comment InternationalChamberOfCommerce "An international organization whose aim is to promote free trade and private enterprise and to represent business interests at national and international levels .")
(comment InternationalRedCrossAndRedCrescentMovement "An international organization whose aim is to promote worldwide humanitarian aid through the International Committee of the Red Cross (ICRC) in wartime, and International Federation of Red Cross and Red Crescent Societies in peacetime.")
(comment InternationalDevelopmentAssociation "An international organization whose aim is to provide economic loans for low income countries.")
(comment IslamicDevelopmentBank "An international organization whose aim is to promote Islamic economic aid and social development.")
(comment InternationalFundForAgriculturalDevelopment "An international organization whose aim is to promote agricultural development.")
(comment InternationalFinanceCorporation "An international organization whose aim is to support private enterprise in international economic development.")
