(comment OrganizationProductMt "The #$TheoryMicrotheory for describing relationships between types of #$Organization and types of #$Product.")
(comment OrganizationBuildingMt "The #$TheoryMicrotheory for describing relationships between types of #$Organization and types of #$Building.")
(comment Jason-TheHero "The hero who went on a quest with the Argonauts for the Golden Fleece.")
(comment GeopoliticalEntityMt "The #$TheoryMicrotheory for defining #$GeopoliticalEntity and #$Country.  Assertions about any other type of #$GeopoliticalEntity belong in #$PoliticalGeographyMt (or a specMt thereof).")
(comment AcademicOrganizationVocabularyMt "The #$VocabularyMicrotheory for #$AcademicOrganizationMt.")
