(comment veryHighAmountOf "The instance of #$GenericValuePredicate (q.v.) that corresponds to (see #$correspondingGenericValuePredicate) the generic-value function #$VeryHighAmountFn (q.v.).  <code>(#$veryHighAmountOf QUANTTYPE QUANTITY)</code> holds just in case <code>QUANTITY</code> is the #$GenericQuantity that corresponds to a <i>very high amount</i> of <code>QUANTTYPE</code>.
<p>
For example, <code>(#$veryHighAmountOf #$Happiness (#$VeryHighAmountFn #$Happiness))</code> holds.  And <code>(#$levelOfCompatibility OLDTHING NEWTHING #$veryHighAmountOf)</code> holds just in case <code>OLDTHING</code> and <code>NEWTHING</code> are compatible to a very high degree.
<p>
See also #$NoteAboutGenericValuePredicatesAsModifiers.")
