(comment NominatedMemberFn "A unary #$CollectionDenotingFunction that takes an #$Organization to a certain kind of #$AgentTypeByOrganizationStatus (q.v.)  (#$NominatedMemberFn <code>ORG</code>) is the collection <code>NOMINEES</code> consisting of all agents currently nominated for membership in <code>ORG</code>.  Each instance of <code>NOMINEES</code> is not currently a member of <code>ORG</code>, but has been formally proposed for membership.  Depending on the  nature of <code>ORG</code>, a given nominee's actually becoming a member of <code>ORG</code> might either require its surviving some confirmation procedure (see #$AppointedMemberFn) or winning an election (see #$ElectedMemberFn).")
