(comment TypicallyComparesToWRTSlotFn "A binary predicate denoting function, ((#$TypicallyComparesToWRTSlotFn ORDERING MQ-SLOT) COL1 COL2) states that, for most of the instances of COL1 and COL2, if the numerical values of the MQ-SLOTs for them were sorted using ORDERING, COL1 would come before COL2.

For example, ((#$TypicallyComparesToWRTSlotFn #$lessThan #$heightOfObject) #$Bird #$Airplane) states that, typically, most
birds will have a height less than that of most airplanes.")
