(comment TheCurrentInference "#$TheCurrentInference denotes the `current inference' being run on an individual Cyc image.  Note that at any moment there may actually be many current queries running on an image. #$TheCurrentInference serves as a placeholder allowing Cyc to keep track of relevant characteristics (including inference answers, parameters, etc.) of each distinct query.")
