(comment effectsOfModification "A rule macro predicate used to tersely encdoe the effects of actions on objects. <code>(#$effectsOfModification OBJECT OBJECT-ROLE MODIFICATION-TYPE MODIFYING-ROLE MODIFYING-ACTOR-TYPE SENTENCE)</code> means that if there were to be an event <code>EVENT</code> such that:
<pre><code>(isa EVENT MODIFICATION-TYPE)</code></pre>
<pre><code>OBJECT</code> plays <code>OBJECT-ROLE</code> in <code>EVENT</code> (<code>(OBJECT-ROLE EVENT OBJECT)</code>)</pre>
<pre>An temporal thing <code>OBJECT-2</code> plays <code>MODIFYING-ROLE</code> in <code>EVENT</code> (<code>(MODIFYING-ROLE EVENT OBJECT-2)</code>)</pre>
a result of <code>EVENT</code> would be that 
<pre><code>SENTENCE</code></pre>
would become true.")
(comment effectsOfModificationWRTPredTypeAndSitType "A not-assertible rule macro predicate used to constrain the scope of effects of actions on objects when querying. <code>(#$effectsOfModificationWRTPredTypeAndSitType OBJECT OBJECT-ROLE MODIFICATION-TYPE MODIFYING-ROLE MODIFYING-ACTOR-TYPE SENTENCE PRED-CONSTRAINT SIT-TYPE)</code> holds anytime <code>(#$effectsOfModification OBJECT OBJECT-ROLE MODIFICATION-TYPE MODIFYING-ROLE MODIFYING-ACTOR-TYPE SENTENCE)</code> holds, given that <code>SENTENCE</code> is sentence whose arg 0 is a predicate of type <code>PRED-CONSTRAINT</code> and refers to the collection <code>SIT-TYPE</code>.")
(comment TubulinDetachmentFromMicrotubule "A specialization of #$ChemicalObjectUnbindingEvent, this is the collection of events in which a #$TubulinMolecule detaches from a #$Microtubule, as part of the microtubule breaking down or shortening.")
