(comment modelPredRequiresAllExistsMin-QuotedIsaArg1 "(#$modelPredRequiresAllExistsMin-QuotedIsaArg1 PRED TYPE1 TYPE2 MIN) means that a constraint on the validity of any quoted instance, INS, of TYPE1 in the model/graph in the operative context is that there is at least MIN number of ARG2s that are instances of TYPE2 such that (PRED INS ARG2).")
(comment linkRequiresObjectLink "(#$linkRequiresObjectLink TYPE LINK1 LINK2 RELN) means that a constraint on the validity of models/graphs that employ TYPE (in the appropriate context) is that if an instance of TYPE, INS, is linked to something, X, via LINK1, then there must be something, Y, linked to INS via LINK2 such that (RELN X Y)")
