(comment linkRequiresNotAllStandInRelnToSomeNode "(#$linkRequiresNotAllStandInRelnToSomeNode LINKPRED PRED RELN CONDITION) means that if (LINKPRED ARG1 ARG2), for ARG1 and ARG2 to be violation free participants in LINK, then no 
 NODE linked to ARG1 via PRED should be such that  
 everything linked to it via RELN stands in CONDITION to ARG2.")
