(comment accessBlockTypeHasPositionWithIndex "A ternary predicate that relates an instance of #$NetworkAccessBlockType and a positive integer to the reified position for that Access Block model.")
(comment modelPredGivesCardinalityConditionForTypeRelatedViaPred "(#$modelPredGivesCardinalityConditionForTypeRelatedViaPred TYPE CARD-PRED PRED) means that the cardinality of the set of things related to an instance of TYPE via PRED is given by the arg2 of CARD-PRED when that instance of TYPE is in arg1.")
