(comment MRBoundEntity-2011 "The subcollection of #$MR2011AgentOntologyTerms that are actual entities expected to be found in reader output.")
(comment dateIsSubsumedByTimeIntervalSeriesType "(#$dateIsSubsumedByTimeIntervalSeriesType DATE INTERVAL-TYPE) means that DATE is subsumed by some instance of INTERVAL-TYPE. When INTERVAL-TYPE is an instance of #$TimeParameter use #$temporallySubsumedBy-InsType which has dedicated removal module support.")
(comment processAccomplishesSitTypeViaSubProcess "<code>
(#$processAccomplishesSitTypeViaSubProcess SCRIPT SCENE SUBSCENE)</code> means that in instances of the event-type <code>SCRIPT</code>, sub-events of type <code>SCENE</code> occur due to, or are explainable in terms of, events of type <code>SUBSCENE</code>, which are sub-events of <code>SCENE</code>.  Note that the relationship between <code>SCRIPT</code>, <code>SCENE</code>, and <code>SUBSCENE</code> are conditional: If an instance of <code>SCRIPT</code> has an instance of <code>SCENE</code> as a sub-event, then that instance of <code>SCENE</code> is explainable in terms of <code>SUBSCENE</code>.  Hence, <code>(#$processAccomplishesSitTypeViaSubProcess SCRIPT SCENE SUBSCENE)</code> does not entail <code>(#$properSubEventTypes SCRIPT SCENE)</code> or <code>(#$properSubEventTypes SCRIPT SUBSCENE)</code>, though the conjunction of the first two will entail the third.")
(comment MRBoundEntity-2011-Practice "The subcollection of #$MR2011AgentOntologyTerms that are actual entities found in sample reader output, or queried about in sample queries.")
(comment MRBoundEntity-2011-Evaluation "The subcollection of #$MR2011AgentOntologyTerms that are actual entities expected to be seen in the final reader output, or queried about in the evaluation questions. ")
