(comment ExtremeMemberFn "(#$ExtremeMemberFn LIST COMPARE FUNC) returns the extreme member of LIST according to binary comparison predicate COMPARE after unary function FUNC is first applied to each list member. By definition, this expression is equivalent to (#$FirstInListFn (#$SortFn (#$SetOfListMembersFn LIST) COMPARE FUNC)).")
