(comment unitCostByShapeForRPTypeForRegion "A ternary predicate that relates an instance of #$ComputingResourcePoolType and an instance of #$ComputeServiceSizeType to an instance of #$MonetaryRate that characterizes its total per unit cost to instantiate a VM from that pool type for the particular region in arg4.")
(comment costPercentageOfAssociatedCategoryForRPType "A ternary predicate that relates an instance of #$ComputingResourcePoolType and an instance of #$ProductCostCategoryType to a number between 0 and 1.  (#$costPercentageOfAssociatedCategoryForRPType RP-TYPE CATEGORY NUM) means that the NUM is the total percent (represented as a real between 0 and 1) of the unit cost associated with deploying resource pools from RP-TYPE that come from costs associated with CATEGORY.")
(comment costOfAssociatedCategoryForRPTypeForReportingPeriod "A quaternary predicate that relates a type of product and an instance of #$ProductCostCategoryType to a monetary value and a time interval.  (#$costOfAssociatedCategoryForRPTypeForReportingPeriod PROD-TYPE CATEGORY INTERVAL MONEY) means that the MONEY is the total cost of the expenses related to CATEGORY for PROD-TYPE during INTERVAL.")
(comment LicenseTypeByDataDistributionRight "A collection of collections.  Every Instance of #$LicenseTypeByDataDistributionRight is a collection of instances of #$License-LegalAgreement that include similar license terms with respect to the data distibution rights granted.  E.g. A license that allows limited external distribution would be an instance of an instance of this collection.    ")
(comment LicenseTypeForProduct "A collection of collections.  Every Instance of #$LicenseTypeForProduct is a collection of instances of #$License-LegalAgreement that specify some particular user right with respect to a licensed product -- e.g. a copy of a movie, computer program, book, a stock analysis report, etc.  ")
(comment LicenseTypeByLicenseScope "A collection of collections.  Every Instance of #$LicenseTypeByLicenseScope is a collection of instances of #$License-LegalAgreement that include similar license terms with respect to the license scope -- the class of potential licensed users.  E.g. A type of license that allows enterprise wide use would be an instance of an instance of this collection.  Note that this is orthogonal to the fee schedule.  E.g. a license may may a \"per site\" scope yet have a tiered or per user fee under the terms of the license.  the scope merely identifies the class of potential licensed users.")
(comment LicenseTypeByFeeType "A collection of collections.  Every Instance of #$LicenseTypeByFeeType is a collection of instances of #$License-LegalAgreement that include similar license terms with respect to the fee schedules.  For example the collection of licenses whose terms indicate a \"per access\" or \"per user\" fee would be an instance of this collection.")
(comment CompoundQueryFn "(#$CompoundQueryFn . QUERIES) denotes a complex query with multiple subqueries, the answers to which all contribute to answering a single larger question.")
